    },
    {
      "id": "core-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 216.7,
      "height": 27.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#15803d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8051,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "v2 相对 v1 改了什么",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "v2 相对 v1 改了什么",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "core-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85,
      "y": 205,
      "width": 447.10000000000014,
      "height": 191.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#14532d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8052,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "v1 已经少搬 HBM，但还不够快：\n1. 非 matmul 操作占比高\n2. 只按 batch/head 并行，长序列小 batch 时 SM 不满\n3. sliced-K 需要 warp 间写 SMEM、同步、归并\n\nv2 的三板斧：\n减少 rescale/mask/bound check 等非 matmul\n沿 sequence 维度增加 CTA 并行\n从 sliced-K 改为 sliced-Q，减少 warp 间通信",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "v1 已经少搬 HBM，但还不够快：\n1. 非 matmul 操作占比高\n2. 只按 batch/head 并行，长序列小 batch 时 SM 不满\n3. sliced-K 需要 warp 间写 SMEM、同步、归并\n\nv2 的三板斧：\n减少 rescale/mask/bound check 等非 matmul\n沿 sequence 维度增加 CTA 并行\n从 sliced-K 改为 sliced-Q，减少 warp 间通信",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pseudo-panel",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 135,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2563eb",
      "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
