      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8075,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "面试讲法：v2 是工程调度升级",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "面试讲法：v2 是工程调度升级",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "right-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1245,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 577.1500000000003,
      "height": 318.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#78350f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8076,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "一句话：\nv2 没有改变 exact attention 的数学，主要是让计算更像高效 GEMM。\n\n三个关键词：\n1. fewer non-matmul FLOPs\n   Tensor Core 做 matmul 很快，FP32 exp/max/mask 相对昂贵。\n\n2. sequence parallelism\n   长序列、小 batch、少 head 时，不能只靠 B*H 个 CTA。\n\n3. sliced-Q work partitioning\n   Q 行天然独立，按 Q 切能减少 shared memory 通信。\n\n过渡到 v3：\nA100 上 v2 已经不错，但 H100 有 TMA/WGMMA/FP8，新硬件能力没吃满。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "一句话：\nv2 没有改变 exact attention 的数学，主要是让计算更像高效 GEMM。\n\n三个关键词：\n1. fewer non-matmul FLOPs\n   Tensor Core 做 matmul 很快，FP32 exp/max/mask 相对昂贵。\n\n2. sequence parallelism\n   长序列、小 batch、少 head 时，不能只靠 B*H 个 CTA。\n\n3. sliced-Q work partitioning\n   Q 行天然独立，按 Q 切能减少 shared memory 通信。\n\n过渡到 v3：\nA100 上 v2 已经不错，但 H100 有 TMA/WGMMA/FP8，新硬件能力没吃满。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
